invariant: INV-13
file: io.c
catches: unit
reason: io_send_all stops after the first call that moves a byte, so a
  socket that took part of a record drops the rest, and the session goes
  on after a cut record. bin/unit's send that moves 3 bytes a call
  objects.

--- old
        p += sent;
        n -= (size_t)sent;
--- new
        p += sent;
        n = 0;
